Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------

The refactor keeps the existing user-facing behavior while simplifying the
frontend state model:

- BarWidget.qml is the single frontend owner of backend status.
- Panel.qml consumes that status instead of running its own status process.
- Startup-language changes no longer use optimistic frontend state; the UI
  re-reads the backend source of truth after a successful mutation.
- The existing one-second reconciliation polling is intentionally retained for
  simplicity and self-healing behavior.
- Safety-critical Bash behavior from upstream is retained, including backups,
  atomic file replacement, idempotent configuration, and refusal to rewrite
  ambiguous Rime YAML.

